---
// Bosses 分类聚合页 —— CollectionPage schema（方案 3.1：列表页不标 Article）。
// 正式版已发售；Open Beta、预告片和前作信息继续保留为历史证据，零售版结论逐项核实。
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MediaFigure from '../../components/MediaFigure.astro';
import { SITE_IMAGES } from '../../data/images';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import PreReleaseNotice from '../../components/PreReleaseNotice.astro';
import StatusBadge from '../../components/StatusBadge.astro';
import { BOSSES, BOSS_ROSTER_NOTE, BOSS_KNOWN_ISSUE } from '../../data/bosses';

const title = 'Mortal Shell 2 Bosses — All 18 Boss Names from Official Patch Notes';
const description =
  'All eighteen Mortal Shell 2 boss names from Cold Symmetry\'s official Week 1 Update patch notes, with named attacks and balance numbers for The Monolith and The Lost Child.';

const crumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Bosses', url: '/bosses/' },
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} schemaType="collection" breadcrumb={crumbs}>
  <Breadcrumb items={crumbs} />

  <header class="mb-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ash-100 md:text-4xl">Mortal Shell 2 Bosses Guide</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg text-ash-400">
      Eighteen named bosses and minibosses, taken from <strong>Cold Symmetry's own patch notes</strong> rather
      than from a community list. Valve hides every boss achievement in this game, so the roster was invisible
      until the developer published a fix list naming each encounter. Fifteen are named in the Week 1 Update's
      "Bosses and Minibosses" section with specific attacks; three more —
      Vellen, Larreth and The Silent Sester — surface in its softlock and riposte fixes. Two bosses have exact
      balance numbers from Balance Patch 1. What is not here: phase charts, parry windows and drop tables,
      because the developer has never published them.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="mb-6"><PreReleaseNotice /></div>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <MediaFigure
      src={SITE_IMAGES.cathedralBoss.src}
      alt={SITE_IMAGES.cathedralBoss.alt}
      width={SITE_IMAGES.cathedralBoss.width}
      height={SITE_IMAGES.cathedralBoss.height}
      credit={SITE_IMAGES.cathedralBoss.credit}
    />
  </div>

  <div class="overflow-x-auto surface-card">
    <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
      <thead class="bg-ash-900 text-left text-ash-300">
        <tr>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Boss / encounter</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Known info</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Location</th>
          <th class="px-4 py-3 font-semibold">Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          BOSSES.map((b) => (
            <tr class="border-t border-white/5 align-top hover:bg-ash-900/50">
              <td class="px-4 py-3 font-medium text-ash-100">
                {b.hasDetailPage ? (
                  <a href={b.detailHref ?? `/bosses/${b.slug}/`} class="text-amber-glow hover:underline">
                    {b.name}
                  </a>
                ) : (
                  b.name
                )}
              </td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-ash-300">
                <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-4">
                  {b.knownInfo.map((i) => (
                    <li>{i}</li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3 text-ash-400">{b.location}</td>
              <td class="px-4 py-3"><StatusBadge status={b.source.status} /></td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <section class="prose-body mt-8 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-ash-300">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ash-100">Why Valve hid every boss achievement</h2>
    <p>{BOSS_ROSTER_NOTE}</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ash-100">The two bosses with exact balance numbers</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Balance Patch 1</strong> (20 August 2026, smithbodie [DEVELOPER]) published exact percentage
      reductions for two bosses:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>
        <strong>The Lost Child:</strong> base damage −10%, maximum health −15%
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The Monolith:</strong> base damage −19%, maximum health −10%
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Those are the only two boss health or damage numbers Cold Symmetry has published. Every other row in the
      table describes named attacks or fixes without percentages.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ash-100">The one boss bug still open</h2>
    <p>{BOSS_KNOWN_ISSUE}</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ash-100">Why most rows have no location</h2>
    <p>
      Patch notes name the boss and describe what was fixed — they are not a walkthrough. Fifteen of the
      eighteen rows say "Not published" for location because Cold Symmetry did not state where the arena is.
      Community-reported coordinates exist for several, but this page keeps official and community evidence
      separate instead of presenting player reports as developer facts.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ash-100">Pre-29-August difficulty reports are outdated</h2>
    <p>
      The Week 1 Update shipped on <strong>29 August 2026</strong>, nine days after launch. Anything written
      before that date describes bosses that have since been retuned, debugged, or reworked. The Monolith's
      attack spam was a bug. Tainted Vestige's ranged attacks missed without reason. The Warden and Urrig
      gained new ice attacks. Sir Isaac's phase transition riposte worked wrong against a wall. If a complaint
      or strategy predates 29 August, cross-check it against the Week 1 change list before trusting it on the
      current build.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
